  "question": {
    "html": "<p>This question is duplicated in #85 and #92</p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> has a mass that is twice the mass of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>. The kinetic energy of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"X\"></span> is four times that of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"Y\"></span>.</p>\n<p>What is the value of <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{\\textit{momentum of X}}{\\textit{momentum of Y}}\"></span>?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
